0,Southeast Babar language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Southeast_Babar_language,"South Babar.Southeast Babar is notable for its drastic phonetic reshapings of inherited Austronesian vocabulary, with extensive consonant loss, unusual reflexes of surviving consonants, and syncope and apocope of vowels.","Babar, Southeast",Austronesian
